{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002904","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002904"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002904","label":"趙鞅（孔子世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"趙鞅","mention_ids":["c-shiji-047-kong:m026-0030","c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0020"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m026-0030","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p026","quote":"趙鞅"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p037","quote":"趙鞅"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-047","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-047-kong:m026-0030","c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0020"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-047-kong:p026","c-shiji-047-kong:p037"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-047-kong"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m026-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"趙鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002904","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p026","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"趙鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002904","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p037","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji047-082","person_id":"cbr-p002904","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-047-kong"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["趙鞅"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p026","quote":"孔子遂至陳，主於司城貞子家。歲餘，吳王夫差伐陳，取三邑而去。趙鞅伐朝歌。楚圍蔡，蔡遷于吳。吳敗越王句踐會稽。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p037","quote":"夏，衞靈公卒，立孫輒，是為衞出公。六月，趙鞅內太子蒯聵于戚。陽虎使太子絻，八人衰絰，偽自衞迎者，哭而入，遂居焉。冬，蔡遷于州來。是歲魯哀公三年，而孔子年六十矣。齊助衞圍戚，以衞太子蒯聵在故也。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示名、字、對話自稱、世系及附贊局部對應；世系求與冉求分開，武不接漢武帝，今皇帝與高皇帝不補姓名。子路仲由明示同指另存，冉有冉求與秦繆秦穆仍待核；附贊不當獨立作者正文或獨立見證。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p026","text":"孔子遂至陳，主於司城貞子家。歲餘，吳王夫差伐陳，取三邑而去。趙鞅伐朝歌。楚圍蔡，蔡遷于吳。吳敗越王句踐會稽。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m026-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m026-0008","start":8,"end":12,"surface":"司城貞子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002878","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m026-0017","start":17,"end":21,"surface":"吳王夫差","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002879","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m026-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"趙鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002904","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m026-0047","start":47,"end":51,"surface":"越王句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002880","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","book_id":"b-shiji-047","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p037","text":"夏，衞靈公卒，立孫輒，是為衞出公。六月，趙鞅內太子蒯聵于戚。陽虎使太子絻，八人衰絰，偽自衞迎者，哭而入，遂居焉。冬，蔡遷于州來。是歲魯哀公三年，而孔子年六十矣。齊助衞圍戚，以衞太子蒯聵在故也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"衞靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002873","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"孫輒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m037-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"衞出公","k